        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Warning</strong>: This is no conventional game. It’s a meta-horror experience: play with caution… and don’t trust everything you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/e19661890fd300eaac173e7faaff83c0.poster.avif?t=1763982948\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/e19661890fd300eaac173e7faaff83c0.webm?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/e19661890fd300eaac173e7faaff83c0.mp4?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The house remembers your steps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an abandoned home that reacts to your presence. Terror rises from the environment, from the tapes you uncover, and from the certainty that something—or someone—is listening in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CoRoT</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game: short, intense, and designed for a single session with headphones, in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/ede1d3690a910cf5f9a253f58931f59e.poster.avif?t=1763982948\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/ede1d3690a910cf5f9a253f58931f59e.webm?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/ede1d3690a910cf5f9a253f58931f59e.mp4?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why play it</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric narrative horror inspired by <i>ANATOMY</i> and <i>PT</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented story told through real cassette recordings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environment: every playthrough feels different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximate length of 1–2 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/d2773a5344064efe9d11d0be1c7c1fa1.avif?t=1763982948\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a damp basement with no memory of how you arrived. The house murmurs, shifts when you blink, and guards secrets that demand to be heard. Amid twisting corridors and voices from the past, your only certainty is doubt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CoRoT</strong> opens a universe of cosmic horror built on silence and solitude. It’s not about surviving—it’s about understanding… if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/502ef4ee5bdc43b7c6057fe39a598942.poster.avif?t=1763982948\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/502ef4ee5bdc43b7c6057fe39a598942.webm?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/502ef4ee5bdc43b7c6057fe39a598942.mp4?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THZ HSSH KLS BTIYHS, SVZ YLSVQLZ ZBZWPYHU</i><br><i>SH HYLUH HZJPLUKL, LS YPV YLNYLZH</i><br><i>ZVTIYHZ UHJLU KVUKL AB BSAPTV WHZV TBLYL</i><br><i>F SHZ WBLYAHZ ZL HIYLU OHJPH HFLY</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Warning</strong>: This is no conventional game. It’s a meta-horror experience: play with caution… and don’t trust everything you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/e19661890fd300eaac173e7faaff83c0.poster.avif?t=1763982948\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/e19661890fd300eaac173e7faaff83c0.webm?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/e19661890fd300eaac173e7faaff83c0.mp4?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The house remembers your steps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an abandoned home that reacts to your presence. Terror rises from the environment, from the tapes you uncover, and from the certainty that something—or someone—is listening in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CoRoT</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game: short, intense, and designed for a single session with headphones, in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/ede1d3690a910cf5f9a253f58931f59e.poster.avif?t=1763982948\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/ede1d3690a910cf5f9a253f58931f59e.webm?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/ede1d3690a910cf5f9a253f58931f59e.mp4?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why play it</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric narrative horror inspired by <i>ANATOMY</i> and <i>PT</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented story told through real cassette recordings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environment: every playthrough feels different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximate length of 1–2 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/d2773a5344064efe9d11d0be1c7c1fa1.avif?t=1763982948\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a damp basement with no memory of how you arrived. The house murmurs, shifts when you blink, and guards secrets that demand to be heard. Amid twisting corridors and voices from the past, your only certainty is doubt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CoRoT</strong> opens a universe of cosmic horror built on silence and solitude. It’s not about surviving—it’s about understanding… if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/502ef4ee5bdc43b7c6057fe39a598942.poster.avif?t=1763982948\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/502ef4ee5bdc43b7c6057fe39a598942.webm?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527920/extras/502ef4ee5bdc43b7c6057fe39a598942.mp4?t=1763982948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THZ HSSH KLS BTIYHS, SVZ YLSVQLZ ZBZWPYHU</i><br><i>SH HYLUH HZJPLUKL, LS YPV YLNYLZH</i><br><i>ZVTIYHZ UHJLU KVUKL AB BSAPTV WHZV TBLYL</i><br><i>F SHZ WBLYAHZ ZL HIYLU OHJPH HFLY</i></p>",
